# Words right after a marker_homograph.voc word that keep its date sense.
# Postposed demonstratives "this" (Wiktionary "ăsta", "acesta", Romanian,
# determiner): "vara asta", "vara aceasta". The genitive and the definite
# form of "an" (year, Wiktionary "an", Romanian, noun): "vara anului 2027",
# "mai anul acesta".
asta
ăsta
aceasta
acesta
anul
anului
